ssed\", \"coverage-review-act\"],\n  \"context\": \"session-2026-03-28\"\n})"},{"id":"blk-42722","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48151","text":"Always use "},{"id":"spn-48152","marks":["code"],"text":"transition_goal"},{"id":"spn-48153","text":" (not "},{"id":"spn-48154","marks":["code"],"text":"update_goal"},{"id":"spn-48155","text":") for status changes — provides audit trail. Include "},{"id":"spn-48156","marks":["code"],"text":"reason"},{"id":"spn-48157","text":" and evidence in metadata."}]},{"id":"blk-42723","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-48158","text":"Set progress"}]},{"id":"blk-42724","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.6, metadata: {\n  \"basis\": \"3 of 5 sub-goals completed\"\n})"},{"id":"blk-42725","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48159","marks":["bold"],"text":"Progress benchmarks (base on evidence, not optimism):"}]},{"id":"blk-42726","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42728","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48160","text":"0.0 — not started"}]}],"id":"blk-42727","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42730","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48161","text":"0.1-0.3 — early exploration, initial nodes stored"}]}],"id":"blk-42729","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42732","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48162","text":"0.3-0.5 — core knowledge captured, key sub-goals active"}]}],"id":"blk-42731","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42734","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48163","text":"0.5-0.7 — substantial coverage, most sub-goals done"}]}],"id":"blk-42733","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42736","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48164","text":"0.7-0.9 — near complete, verifying/testing"}]}],"id":"blk-42735","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-42738","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-48165","text":"1.0 — all criteria met"}]}],"id":"blk-42737","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list",